@Orion.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5092
@UserId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 1. Register a valid adventurer (expects 201 Created)
POST {{Orion.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Arthur",
  "middleName": "Pendragon",
  "email": "Arthur.Pendragon@Orion.Realm",
  "username": null,
  "password": "Orion!Spell2026",
  "confirmPassword": "Orion!Spell2026",
  "acceptTerms": true
}

### 2. Register with invalid cipher runes & unchecked terms (expects 400 Bad Request ProblemDetails)
POST {{Orion.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Arthur",
  "middleName": null,
  "email": "weak@orion.realm",
  "username": "weak_mage",
  "password": "weak",
  "confirmPassword": "mismatch",
  "acceptTerms": false
}

### 3. Get adventurer by ID (expects 200 OK or 404 Not Found)
GET {{Orion.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/{{UserId}}
Accept: application/json

### 4. List active adventurers with pagination (expects 200 OK)
GET {{Orion.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### 5. Update adventurer profile (expects 200 OK)
PUT {{Orion.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/{{UserId}}/profile
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Arthur",
  "middleName": "High King",
  "username": "king_arthur",
  "avatarUrl": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1?v=4"
}

### 6. Soft-delete adventurer (expects 204 No Content)
DELETE {{Orion.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/{{UserId}}
